# Doc Editor

::summary
The doc editor surface (a full surface, not a sheet) in the shell wrapper: circled back, Cancel/Save bar, formatting bar, and the SurfDoc source area. Every save is a version; autosave every 30s.
::

::app-shell[name=doc-editor layout=sidebar-main-panel height=900]

:::sidebar[position=left width=240]

::::toolbar
- text[value="Surfspace" size=22]
